# Residual `detail/` includes in public headers (docs/notes/2026-11-m8-ap1-api-review.md
# section 7). The export contract forbids a public header including a `detail/` header;
# this list is the SHRINK-ONLY allow-list of what remains until the group named on each
# line moves the type that needs it. It may only shrink: a pair absent from this file is
# refused, and a pair present here that no longer occurs in the installed headers is
# refused too (delete the line). The rule is armed without exceptions, and this file
# deleted, when B4 closes.
#
# format: <public header, relative to include/hven>|<included path>|<group that removes it>
drivers/trace.h|hven/detail/interior/iterate_info.h|B4
drivers/trace.h|hven/detail/qp/ipqp_evidence.h|B4
